  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridge to Safety (Migration &amp; Displacement Grant)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to reinforce the meaningful participation of migrants in policy influencing through a digital engagement platform. In 2025, the project focused on adapting outreach strategies to align with changing local contexts and ensuring the continued safety of community mediators. Key pillars include:
      1) Providing vulnerable groups with protection information;
      2) Supporting community-led responses to migration risks;
      3) Strengthening the capacity of local civil society organizations to advance human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
